cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this research artifact and separately acknowledge the MultiPref dataset."
title: "ConsensusCensor: An Open Research Artifact on Consensus Filtering and Robust Statistical Estimation from Human Preference Data"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "ConsensusCensor contributors"
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A completed CPU-only research artifact comparing existing selection-aware
  likelihood, audit, design-based residual, post-stratified, and model-assisted
  estimators under controlled human-preference annotation censoring.
  No new statistical theory or original algorithmic contribution is established.
keywords:
  - human preference data
  - consensus filtering
  - survey sampling
  - model-assisted estimation
repository-code: "https://github.com/Qqqq5910/ConsensusCensor"
